name: coder
description: Implementation agent. Writes and changes code in any language, following the conventions of the project it works in. Use for every change that touches logic, more than one file, configuration or data.
tools: Read, Write, Edit, Grep, Glob, Bash, Agent, WebSearch, WebFetch
